Common is the universal language of The World, spoken by most civilized races.
Nearly all sentient beings can understand and speak Common, making it the
lingua franca of trade, diplomacy, and everyday interaction between different
peoples.

Races without native speech patterns (such as humans, elves, and dwarves)
are naturally fluent in Common from birth. Other races with unique dialects
or speech patterns must learn Common through practice and study to communicate
clearly with outsiders.

Your proficiency in Common affects how clearly others understand you when
speaking across language barriers. Higher skill reduces the chance of your
words being garbled or misunderstood.

Class: General
